        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A puzzle game where <strong>every block moves at once</strong>.<br>Press an arrow key, and all blocks on the grid slide in that direction until they can’t move any further.<br>Your goal is to guide each <strong>cat block</strong> to its <strong>own fish</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every move matters — since all cats move together,<br>a single decision can reshape the entire puzzle.<br>Finding the right sequence of moves feels like solving a delicate chain reaction,<br>where logic and foresight are the keys to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through more challenging stages,<br>you’ll need to think several steps ahead,<br>predicting how each move will affect every cat on the board.<br>It’s simple to play, but deeply satisfying to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its warm atmosphere and clever design,<br>this game offers a calm yet thoughtful puzzle experience.<br>Plan carefully, move wisely,<br>and make sure every cat gets its fish.</p>",
